spice
* SPICE Netlist
* NMOS (Drain, Gate, Source)
M1 2 6 0 NMOS

* PMOS (Drain, Gate, Source)
M2 2 3 3 PMOS
M3 3 4 3 PMOS

* Current Source
Ib 4 0 DC [current_value]

* Voltage Sources
Vin 6 0 DC [input_voltage_value]
VDD 3 0 DC [supply_voltage_value]

* Capacitor
CL 2 0 [capacitance_value]

* End of Netlist